There are three main files for composition models in this folder:
- Main_simpleModel.jl: This file contains the main model code for a simple composition model
- Main_unitPresentation.jl: This file extends the simple model code by providing unit presentation 
- Main_includingGGV.jl: This file contains the main model code inclduing GGVs

The file Main_assignUnits.jl contains the code for the second model run, where units are assigned to the compositions from the first model run.
The composition result on which the unit assignment should be done, has to be specified in the code.

CompositionModel_functions.jl contains functions that are used in the main model files